@startuml
' Architecture ticket 496; Product UC-001, UC-002, UC-003 지원.
title Ticket 496 — 평가 harness 모듈 책임
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
actor "CLI 사용자" as CLI
component "bin/harness-eval.mjs" as EvalCLI
component EvalRunner
component CaseLoader
component WorkspaceManager
component WorktreeManager
component CodexProcessAdapter
component ExternalSystemPort
component GitHubStub
component RecordingAdapter
component ExplicitIntegrationAdapter
component EventJournal
component HardGateGrader
component OutcomeGrader
component QualityGrader
component EfficiencyCollector
component Report
component "실제 Codex / harness" as RealHarness
CLI --> EvalCLI : 호출
EvalCLI --> EvalRunner : 케이스 시작
EvalRunner --> CaseLoader : 케이스 로드
EvalRunner --> WorkspaceManager : preflight / provision
WorkspaceManager --> WorktreeManager : 병렬 plan worktree
EvalRunner --> CodexProcessAdapter : launch / observe / terminate
CodexProcessAdapter --> RealHarness : 프로세스 lifecycle
EvalRunner --> ExternalSystemPort : 정규화된 요청/응답
ExternalSystemPort <|.. GitHubStub
ExternalSystemPort <|.. RecordingAdapter
ExternalSystemPort <|.. ExplicitIntegrationAdapter
EvalRunner --> EventJournal : append / replay / checkpoint
EvalRunner --> HardGateGrader : 결정론적 게이트
EvalRunner --> OutcomeGrader : 결정론적 결과
EvalRunner --> QualityGrader : artifact bundle
EvalRunner --> EfficiencyCollector : 증거 수집
EvalRunner --> Report : 최종 결과 결합
note right of ExternalSystemPort
유일한 외부 경계이며 기본 mutation은 거부한다.
Replay 불일치/누락 시 live fallback은 없다.
end note
note right of WorktreeManager
고정된 group base에서 독립 실행 가능한 병렬 plan용 detached worktree.
순차 chain은 하나의 실행 라인을 공유하며 commit/branch/merge 소유권이나 암묵적 강제 cleanup은 없다.
end note
note bottom of EventJournal
Append-only JSONL, replay, quarantine, checkpoint projection을 사용하며 evidence는 worktree 밖에 둔다.
end note
@enduml
